{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/92e53ebb08e5a0c79dbb60f3088a8e00.webp?t=1763070483\" width=363 height=50 /></span>In StableBound, players immerse themselves in the role of a horse exploring a vast and vibrant world filled with challenges. They'll encounter various tasks and activities, including breeding, catching wild horses, and customizing their own equine companion and taking care of their needs as a wild horse would. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/795bcd1bc551148eec6fc26d1ef2a905.webp?t=1763070483\" width=417 height=50 /></span>StableBound offers players the flexibility to control their horse using either a keyboard and mouse or an Xbox/Playstation controller. The player controls the horse and can go through various gaits as they explore. There are unique biomes to explore, each offering its own set of challenges and rewards, there's much to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2725800?t=1763070483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763070483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763070483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763070483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/92e53ebb08e5a0c79dbb60f3088a8e00.webp?t=1763070483\" width=363 height=50 /></span>In StableBound, players immerse themselves in the role of a horse exploring a vast and vibrant world filled with challenges. They'll encounter various tasks and activities, including breeding, catching wild horses, and customizing their own equine companion and taking care of their needs as a wild horse would. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/795bcd1bc551148eec6fc26d1ef2a905.webp?t=1763070483\" width=417 height=50 /></span>StableBound offers players the flexibility to control their horse using either a keyboard and mouse or an Xbox/Playstation controller. The player controls the horse and can go through various gaits as they explore. There are unique biomes to explore, each offering its own set of challenges and rewards, there's much to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wren Stout","Jhon Vergara"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/header.jpg?t=1763070483","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Wrennaissance Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High